/T (To minimize communication overhead in federated traffic forecasting, we introduce three key enhancements: Gradient Sparsification, Model Quantization \(8-bit\), and Event-Driven Aggregation. By sending compressed parameter updates only when traffic patterns shift, we drastically cut bandwidth consumption while retaining top-tier prediction accuracy.)
/E (To minimize communication overhead in federated traffic forecasting, we introduce three key enhancements: Gradient Sparsification, Model Quantization \(8-bit\), and Event-Driven Aggregation. By sending compressed parameter updates only when traffic patterns shift, we drastically cut bandwidth consumption while retaining top-tier prediction accuracy.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [23]
>>
