710 0 obj
<<
/Title (Real-time traffic prediction is essential for smart cities, but transmitting raw sensor data to centralized cloud servers increases bandwidth usage and creates privacy risks. Federated Learning addresses these challenges by training AI models locally at edge nodes and sharing only model updates. However, frequent synchronization can still cause network congestion and resource overhead.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 532 0 R
/Prev 634 0 R
/Next 711 0 R
>>
endobj
711 0 obj
<<
/Title (This project aims to minimize communication costs while maintaining high prediction accuracy using techniques such as model compression, quantization, and adaptive communication frequency. By evaluating communication overhead, prediction accuracy, and latency under varying network conditions, the proposed approach seeks to deliver privacy-preserving, resource-efficient, and scalable traffic forecasting for real-world)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 532 0 R
/Prev 710 0 R
/Next 635 0 R
>>
endobj
712 0 obj
<<
/Title (A3-PS001-TC001)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 635 0 R
/Next 713 0 R
>>
